WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
只数蓝队把球传给队友的次数。
Count only passes between blue players.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:17.000
蓝队传了几次？
How many passes does the blue team make?

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.100
六次。球场中央还有一位撑黄伞的来客。
Six. A visitor with a yellow umbrella also crossed the court.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:25.000
如果刚才没有留意，这正是我们要观察的现象。
If you missed it, that is the phenomenon we are exploring.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.400
数球时，你得持续选出同一队、同一个球。
Counting requires repeatedly selecting the same team and ball.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.000
任务之外的东西即使在视野里，也可能没进入觉察。
An item outside the task can be visible and still escape awareness.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.400
西蒙斯和沙布里做过传球计数实验。
Simons and Chabris conducted a pass-counting experiment.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:44.000
有些观察者漏报了意外角色。刚才是重新设计的示范。
Some observers missed the unexpected figure. Our challenge is an original demonstration.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.800
第二遍可以换任务。把目光放到横穿球场的路线。
Change your task on a second look. Attend to the path across the court.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:54.000
注意分给什么，会改变你最后能报告什么。
What you attend to changes what you can report.
